<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine House to back specific tax on beer.</title>
<headline>Philippine House to back specific tax on beer.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine House of Representatives will back a specific tax on beer and cigarettes, House Speaker Jose de Venecia said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect the House to approve its version of the excise tax on beer and cigarettes tonight,&quot; de Venecia said in a statement after a meeting of a legislative advisory body.</p>
<p>&quot;This version will be a specific tax, not an ad valorem tax ...,&quot; the statement said.</p>
</text>
